# The fleet root IS a git repository (branch `main`, no remote) tracking the fleet map, the
# orchestration CLI and the generated shell helpers. These entries are what keep the clones,
# the secrets and the CLI's dependencies out of it, so they are load-bearing, not insurance.
# Do not remove them.
#
# `clone_*/` rather than `clone_0*/`: the fleet is no longer fixed at three clones, and the
# old glob would have stopped matching at clone_10.
.env.shared
.remember/
clone_*/
node_modules/

# The two shared directories the clones cannot share by symlink or by setting:
#   plans/ -- the plan archive. `plansDirectory` must resolve INSIDE the project root (Claude
#             Code follows symlinks and rejects an escape), so each clone keeps its own real
#             .claude/plans and `orch-util plans collect` moves finished plans in here.
#   tmp/   -- the shared per-ticket Jira cache and per-clone scratch. Each clone's `tmp` is a
#             symlink to it. Holds Jira attachments and live PID files; never committable.
plans/
tmp/
